  "subject": "fix(argocd): ipmi-exporter hydrated output was missing its ServiceMonitor (#1994)",
  "body": "ArgoCD's own Helm render passes the cluster's API versions; kustomize helmCharts does not, so the chart's\nCapabilities check for monitoring.coreos.com/v1 failed. Declare it via helmCharts.apiVersions.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n"
}
